    },
    "Barosense could not empty every store. Try again — nothing was sent anywhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense could not empty every store. Try again — nothing was sent anywhere."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense не зміг очистити всі сховища. Спробуй ще раз — нічого нікуди не надсилалося."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Barosense hasn't built a personal model from your history yet. This will clear what it has learned once your forecast is running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense hasn't built a personal model from your history yet. This will clear what it has learned once your forecast is running."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense ще не побудував персональну модель з твоєї історії. Це очистить накопичене, коли запрацює твій прогноз."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Barosense looks at how barometric pressure lines up with how you feel, using your own data. It is not medical advice and does not replace talking to a doctor — these are personal observations only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense looks at how barometric pressure lines up with how you feel, using your own data. It is not medical advice and does not replace talking to a doctor — these are personal observations only."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Barosense аналізує зв'язок між тиском і самопочуттям на основі твоїх даних. Це не медична порада і не замінює консультацію лікаря — лише персональні спостереження."
          }
        }
      }
    },
